---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import EvidenceImage from '../components/EvidenceImage.astro';
import {equipmentFamilies} from '../data/company';
import {photo} from '../data/evidence';
import '../styles/factory-tour.css';
const images=['milling-enclosure-operation','turning-operation','five-axis-machine-wide','cmm-room'];
const links=['View CNC milling capabilities','View turning capabilities','Check your part size and setup','View quality control'];
const stages=[
 {title:'Requirements & quotation',intro:'Confirm requirements and evaluate your drawing or model before agreeing the quotation.',points:['Review geometry, tool access, workholding and critical requirements.','Identify material, finish, quantity, inspection scope and delivery basis.','The quote states inclusions, separately priced work and approval steps.']},
 {title:'Sample & inspection',intro:'Machine the sample or prototype, then inspect it and review the results with you.',points:['Prototype orders start from 1 piece.','First-article and dimensional reports are available for ordered features.','Records reference the drawing revision, part or batch and agreed measurement method.']},
 {title:'Approval & production',intro:'Proceed to production after sample approval, with the agreed requirements in place.',points:['Confirm production timing and inspection requirements in the quotation.','Material and finishing documentation is provided as specified in the order.','Agree the traceability references needed for purchasing and acceptance.']},
 {title:'Final QC & shipment',intro:'Complete final quality checks and prepare the parts and agreed documents for dispatch.',points:['Protect vulnerable part features during packing.','Provide the agreed packing list, commercial invoice and shipment information.','Delivery responsibilities are identified in the quotation.']},
];
---
<Layout title="Our factory and manufacturing workflow" description="Explore LZZ's Hangzhou workshop, CNC machining equipment and production workflow.">
<div class="ft-page">
<section class="ft-hero" aria-labelledby="factory-title"><EvidenceImage id="workshop-wide" loading="eager" sizes="100vw" class="ft-hero-photo"/><div class="ft-wrap ft-hero-inner"><div class="ft-hero-copy"><h1 id="factory-title">Our factory<br/>in Hangzhou</h1><p>A 1,500 m² production facility with 40+ CNC machines, supporting custom parts from 1 piece. An engineering team with more than 15 years in CNC machining.</p><a class="ft-hero-action" href="#equipment">Explore the equipment</a><p class="ft-hero-caption">LZZ machining workshop · Original photograph</p></div></div></section>
<section class="ft-scale" id="production-capacity" aria-label="Factory scale and reference capacity"><div class="ft-wrap ft-facts"><dl><div><dt>Founded in Hangzhou</dt><dd>2017</dd></div><div><dt>Production facility</dt><dd>1,500 m²</dd></div><div><dt>CNC machines</dt><dd>40+</dd></div></dl><div class="ft-capacity"><h2>About 100,000<span>parts per month</span></h2><p>Reference capacity only. Actual output depends on part geometry, material, finishing and production mix.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="ft-wrap ft-section" id="equipment" aria-labelledby="equipment-title"><div class="ft-heading"><div><h2 id="equipment-title">CNC machining<br/>and inspection equipment</h2></div><p>The workshop combines machining centers, lathes, turn-mill and multi-axis machines. The equipment notes below link to the relevant machining and inspection services.</p></div><div class="ft-equipment">{equipmentFamilies.map((item,index)=><article class:list={['ft-machine',{'ft-machine-main':index===0}]}><a class="ft-machine-photo" href={photo(images[index]).src} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label={'View original photograph: '+item.name}><EvidenceImage id={images[index]} sizes={index===0?'(max-width:760px) 90vw, 42vw':'(max-width:760px) 40vw, 21vw'}/></a><div class="ft-machine-copy"><h3>{item.name}</h3><p>{item.use}</p><a class="ft-link" href={item.href+(index===2?'#size-and-setup-review':index===3?'':'#engineering-fit')}>{links[index]}</a></div></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="ft-workshop ft-section" id="workshop-photographs" aria-labelledby="workshop-title"><div class="ft-wrap"><div class="ft-heading"><div><h2 id="workshop-title">The machining floor</h2></div><p>These photographs from our company archive show the workshop and operators among the CNC machines. Dates refer to the original source files or folders.</p></div><div class="ft-scenes"><figure><a href={photo('workshop-operators-2025').src} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View original photograph of workshop operators"><EvidenceImage id="workshop-operators-2025" sizes="(max-width:760px) 90vw, 58vw"/></a><figcaption>Operators among the CNC machines.<br/>Original production-floor photograph; source file dated November 2025.</figcaption></figure><figure><a href={photo('workshop-aisle').src} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View original photograph of the workshop aisle"><EvidenceImage id="workshop-aisle" sizes="(max-width:760px) 60vw, 28vw"/></a><figcaption>Machining centers along the workshop aisle.<br/>Original photograph; source folder dated December 2025.</figcaption></figure><figure class="ft-scenes-archive"><a href={photo('shipping-example').src} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="View original packing archive photograph"><EvidenceImage id="shipping-example" sizes="(max-width:760px) 90vw, 42vw"/></a><figcaption>Packing archive · November 2022.<br/>Original packing archive photograph.</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>
<section class="ft-wrap ft-inspection ft-section" aria-labelledby="inspection-title"><figure><EvidenceImage id="cmm-detail" sizes="(max-width:760px) 90vw, 40vw"/><figcaption>Coordinate measuring machine detail · Original photograph</figcaption></figure><div><h2 id="inspection-title">Dimensional inspection<br/>against your drawing</h2><p>We use CMM, height gauges and optical projectors to check part dimensions. Inspection scope and measurement methods are confirmed in your quotation, based on the drawing and requirements.</p><a class="ft-link" href="/quality/">View quality control</a></div></section>
<section class="ft-process ft-section" id="workflow" aria-labelledby="workflow-title"><div class="ft-wrap"><div class="ft-heading"><div><h2 id="workflow-title">Our working process</h2><a class="ft-link" href="/resources/how-we-work/">See how we work</a></div><p id="order-deliverables">The quotation sets out the work, approval steps and delivery requirements. Sample approval and the agreed inspection plan guide the move into production.</p></div><ol class="ft-stages">{stages.map(stage=><li><h3>{stage.title}</h3><p>{stage.intro}</p></li>)}</ol><details class="ft-process-notes"><summary>Purchasing, inspection and delivery requirements</summary><dl>{stages.map(stage=><div><dt>{stage.title}</dt><dd><ul>{stage.points.map(point=><li>{point}</li>)}</ul></dd></div>)}</dl><p>For order preparation, review the <a href="/resources/how-we-work/#quotation-scope">quotation scope</a>, <a href="/quality/#order-documentation">inspection documentation</a>, <a href="/capabilities/prototype-machining/">prototype orders</a> and <a href="/resources/custom-cnc-parts-shipping-checklist/#delivery-package">packing and delivery</a>.</p></details></div></section>
</div>
</Layout>
<script>
if (window.location.hash === '#documents') window.location.replace('/about/#documents');
</script>

<style>
 .ft-scenes .ft-scenes-archive{grid-column:1/-1;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:32px;align-items:center}.ft-scenes .ft-scenes-archive :global(img){height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3;object-fit:cover}.ft-scenes .ft-scenes-archive figcaption{margin:0}
 .ft-stages>li{border-top:1px solid #dce1e4;padding-top:24px}.ft-stages>li h3{margin-top:0}
 .ft-process-notes{margin-top:40px;border-block:1px solid #dce1e4}.ft-process-notes>summary{cursor:pointer;padding-block:20px}.ft-process-notes dl{margin-block:12px 24px}.ft-process-notes dl>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.7fr) minmax(0,1.3fr);gap:24px;padding-block:20px}.ft-process-notes dt{font-weight:550;line-height:1.5}.ft-process-notes dd{margin:0}.ft-process-notes dd ul{margin:0;padding-left:20px}.ft-process-notes dd li{margin-block:0 10px;line-height:1.6}.ft-process-notes>p{margin-bottom:24px}.ft-process-notes a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
 @media(max-width:760px){.ft-scenes .ft-scenes-archive,.ft-process-notes dl>div{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}}
</style>
